  "translation": "Olgeta dispela olgeta i ol pikinini bilong Heman, man i lukim tok profet bilong king, long ol tok bilong Elohim, bilong salim korn i kamap; na Elohim i givim long Heman foaten pikinini man na tripela pikinini meri.",
